   ],
   "left_edge_quantiles": [
    0.1,
    0.1,
    0.3
   ],
   "primary": "right_edge",
   "note": "Fixed A PRIORI (ercot-161 precommit discipline); never selected on model absorption. Right-edge is the primary (conservative rising step); left-edge is the disclosed lower-bound variant, not used. p50+ is HCAP-degenerate by measurement, so the top tranche is the $5,000 cap block."
  },
  "frozen": "rule 23 \u2014 re-derive only on a SCED disclosure source-data update, never because a residual moved."
